andards. All our products are sourced directly from supported local farmers, ensuring premium quality, consistent supply, and sustainable practices.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2458\">We are ready to supply premium Purple Eggplant along with other tropical fruits, fresh vegetables, and authentic Indonesian spices in bulk for industrial and export needs. Contact us today for the best offer and become part of our global distribution network.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2476\">Specification:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2613\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2491\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2491\">Unit: Pack</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2521\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2521\">Packaging: Standing Pouch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2549\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2549\">Appearance: Deep Purple</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2590\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2590\">Condition: Not Rotten, Not Sprouting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2613\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2613\">Skin: Not Wrinkled</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','Terong-Ungu_Purple-Eggplant_01102025112406.png','Terong Ungu','Purple Eggplant','Terong Ungu','Purple Eggplant','Terong ungu kualitas tinggi','High-quality Purple Eggplant','terong-ungu','purple-eggplant','2025-10-01 04:24:07','2025-10-01 04:24:07'),(45,3,'Oyong','Luffa','<p data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"682\">From orchard to table &mdash; inilah perjalanan Oyong dari tanah subur Indonesia.<br data-start=\"260\" data-end=\"263\">Oyong, atau biasa disebut gambas, dikenal dengan bentuk lonjong beralur, kulit hijau segar, serta tekstur daging yang lembut setelah dimasak. Sayuran ini populer dalam berbagai masakan tradisional Asia, terutama sebagai bahan utama sup dan tumisan. Dengan kandungan serat, vitamin, dan mineralnya, oyong menjadi salah satu komoditas hortikultura bernilai