eal maturity, carefully sorted, and packaged according to international distribution standards. All our products come directly from trusted local farmers, guaranteeing<strong> </strong>premium quality, consistent supply, and sustainable production.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2687\">We are ready to supply premium Chinese Cabbage along with tropical fruits, fresh vegetables, and authentic Indonesian spices in large quantities for industrial and export needs. Contact us now for the best offer and become part of our global distribution network.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2710\">Specifications:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2882\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2729\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2729\">Unit: Pack</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2730\" data-end=\"2763\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2763\">Packaging: Standing Pouch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2810\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2810\">Appearance: Light Green to Pale Yellow</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2811\" data-end=\"2855\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2813\" data-end=\"2855\">Condition: Not Rotten, Not Sprouting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2882\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2882\">Leaves: Not Wilted</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','Sawi-Putih-Horeca_-Chinese-Cabbage-Horeca_08102025122556.png','Sawi Putih Horace ',' Chinese Cabbage Horeca','Sawi Putih Horeca',' Chinese Cabbage Horeca','Sawi putih kualitas tinggi ','High-quality chinese cabbage ','sawi-putih-horeca','-chinese-cabbage-horeca','2025-10-08 05:25:57','2025-10-08 05:25:57'),(80,3,'Sawi Putih Packaging',' Chinese Cabbage Packaging ','<p data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"446\">From orchard to table &mdash; inilah perjalanan Sawi Putih segar dari tanah subur Indonesia.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"757\">Sawi Putih, atau Chinese Cabbage, dikenal dengan bentuk daunnya yang lebar, berlapis lembut, serta rasanya yang segar dan