offer and become part of our global distribution network.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2596\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Specification:<br data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2460\">&bull; Unit: Pack<br data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2475\">&bull; Packaging: Standing Pouch<br data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2505\">&bull; Appearance: Clean White<br data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2533\">&bull; Condition: Not Rotten, Not Sprouting<br data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2574\">&bull; Skin: Dry and Firm</p>','Bawang-Putih-_Garlic_14102025121706.png','Bawang Putih','Garlic ','Bawang Putih ','Garlic','Bawang putih kualitas tinggi','High-quality garlic','bawang-putih-','garlic','2025-10-14 05:17:07','2025-10-14 05:17:07'),(108,4,'Daun Pisang','Banana Leaves','<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"493\">From orchard to table &mdash; inilah perjalanan Daun Pisang dari perkebunan tropis Indonesia.<br data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"94\">Daun Pisang telah lama menjadi bagian penting dalam kuliner Nusantara. Dengan permukaan yang lebar, lentur, dan beraroma khas alami, daun ini digunakan sebagai pembungkus makanan, alas saji, maupun bahan pelengkap dalam proses memasak tradisional. Selain memberikan cita rasa alami dan aroma yang menggugah, Daun Pisang juga ramah lingkungan, menjadi alternatif alami pengganti plastik dan kertas.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"839\">Sebagai supplier hortikultura dari Jawa dan Sumatra, kami menyediakan Daun Pisang segar pilihan yang dipetik langsung dari tanaman sehat dan dibersihkan dengan standar higienis tinggi. Setiap helai daun disortir secara manual untuk memastikan ukuran, warna, dan ketahanan sesuai kebutuhan industri makanan, restoran, hingga ekspor global.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"1119\">Kami siap memasok Daun Pisang berkualitas premium dalam jumlah besar, bersama produk hortikultura unggulan lainnya seperti sayuran segar, rempah-rempah, dan buah tropis khas Indonesia. Hubungi kami untuk penawaran terbaik dan solusi pengemasan alami yang ramah lingkungan.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1315\">Spesifikasi:<br data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1136\">&bull; Satuan: Lembar / Ikat<br data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1162\">&bull; Kemasan: Ikatan / Standing Pouch (custom)<br data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1208\">&bull; Warna: Hijau Tua Mengilap<br data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1238\">&bull; Kondisi: Segar, Tidak Robek, Tidak Layu<br data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1282\">&bull; Ukuran: Disesuaikan Kebutuhan</p>','<p data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1796\">From orchard to table &mdash; this is the journey of Banana Leaves from Indonesia&rsquo;s tropical plantations.<br data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1440\">Banana leaves have long been an essential part of Indonesian culinary tradition. With their broad, flexible texture and natural fragrance, they are widely used for food wrapping, serving, and traditional cooking. Besides enhancing flavor and aroma, Banana Leaves are eco-friendly, making them a perfect natural alternative to plastic and paper packaging.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"2120\">As a horticultural supplier from Java and Sumatra, we provide carefully selected fresh Banana Leaves, harvested from healthy plants and cleaned under strict hygiene standards. Each leaf is hand-sorted to ensure ideal size, color, and durability &mdash; suitable for food industries, restaurants, and global export markets.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2378\">We are ready to supply premium Banana Leaves in bulk, along with other top-quality horticultural products such as fresh vegetables, spices, and tropical fruits from Indonesia. Contact us today for the best offers and eco-friendly packaging solutions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2562\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Specification:<br data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2397\">&bull; Unit: Sheet / Bundle<br data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2422\">&bull; Packaging: Bundle / Standing Pouch 