start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2053\">Sayur Lodeh</em>. Setiap kemasan berisi campuran alami terong, labu siam, buah melinjo, daun melinjo, kacang panjang, tempe, nangka muda, jagung, serta bumbu (Royco), siap dimasak dengan cepat dan praktis.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2641\">Seluruh bahan dipilih langsung dari petani lokal di Jawa dan Sumatra, dipanen pada tingkat kematangan sempurna, dan dikemas secara higienis dalam wadah plastik cokelat bening agar kesegaran dan kandungan nutrisinya tetap terjaga. Produk ini cocok untuk rumah tangga, restoran, maupun industri makanan yang ingin menghadirkan kelezatan masakan bersantan khas Indonesia dengan cara yang efisien.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2923\">Kami siap memasok RTC Sayur Lodeh dalam jumlah besar, bersama berbagai sayuran segar, buah tropis, dan rempah khas Indonesia untuk kebutuhan industri maupun ekspor. Hubungi kami hari ini untuk mendapatkan penawaran terbaik dan bergabunglah dalam jaringan distribusi global kami.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"3196\">Spesifikasi:<br data-start=\"2941\" data-end=\"2944\">&bull; Satuan: Pack<br data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"2961\">&bull; Kemasan: Wadah Plastik Cokelat Bening<br data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3003\">&bull; Isi: Terong, Labu Siam, Buah Melinjo, Daun Melinjo, Kacang Panjang, Tempe, Nangka Muda, Jagung, Bumbu (Royco)<br data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3117\">&bull; Kondisi: Siap Masak, Segar, Tidak Layu<br data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3160\">&bull; Penyimpanan: Suhu Dingin (0&ndash;5&deg;C)</p>','<p data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"725\">From orchard to table &mdash; this is the journey of RTC Mixed Vegetables for Coconut Soup from Indonesia&rsquo;s fertile lands.<br data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"331\">RTC (Ready to Cook) Mixed Vegetables for Coconut Soup is a practical blend of freshly prepared vegetables crafted to bring out the authentic taste of Indonesia&rsquo;s traditional <em data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"518\">Sayur Lodeh</em>. Each pack contains a wholesome mix of eggplant, chayote, melinjo fruit, melinjo leaves, long beans, tempeh, young jackfruit, corn, and seasoning (Royco), offering an authentic, ready-to-cook convenience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"1121\">All ingredients are carefully sourced from local farmers in Java and Sumatra, harvested at the perfect stage of ripeness, and hygienically packed in a clear brown plastic container to maintain freshness and nutrition. This product is ideal for households, restaurants, and food industries that aim to deliver the comforting richness of Indonesian coconut-based dishes quickly and efficiently.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1390\">We are ready to supply RTC Mixed Vegetables for Coconut Soup in bulk, along with other fresh vegetables, tropical fruits, and Indonesian spices for industrial and export needs. Contact us today for the best offers and become part of our global distribution network.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1683\">Specification:<br data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1413\">&bull; Unit: Pack<br data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1428\">&bull; Packaging: Clear Brown Plastic Container<br data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1473\">&bull; Contents: Eggplant, Chayote, Melinjo Fruit, Melinjo Leaves, Long Beans, Tempeh, Young Jackfruit, Corn, Seasoning (Royco)<br data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1598\">&bull; Condition: Ready to Cook, Fresh, Not Wilted<br data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1646\">&bull; Storage: Cold Temperature (0&ndash;5&deg;C)</p>','RTC-Sayur-Lodeh_RTC-Mixed-Vegetables-for-Coconut-Soup_14102025132438.png','RTC Sayur Lodeh','RTC Mixed Vegetables for Coconut Soup','RTC Sayur Lodeh','RTC Mixed Vegetables for Coconut Soup','RTC sayur lodeh kualitas tinggi','High-quality RTC mixed vegetables for coconut soup','rtc-sayur-lodeh','rtc-mixed-vegetables-for-coconut-soup','2025-10-14 06:24:40','2025-10-14 06:24:40'),(116,1,'Temulawak ','Javanese turmeric','<p data-start=\"181\" data-end=\"743\">From orchard to table &mdash; inilah perjalanan Temulawak dari tanah subur Indonesia.<br data-start=\"260\" data-end=\"263\">Temulawak dikenal sebagai rimpang khas Nusantara yang memiliki warna kuning-oranye cerah, aroma herbal yang kuat, serta berbagai manfaat kesehatan. Rimpang ini digunakan secara luas dalam jamu tradisional, minuman kesehatan, hingga industri kosmetik dan farmasi berkat kandungan kurkuminoid dan minyak atsirinya yang tinggi. Dengan tampilan segar dan aroma hangat yang khas, Temulawak Indonesia menjadi komoditas herbal yang sangat diminati di pasar domestik maupun internasional.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"1101\">Sebagai supplier hortikultura dari Jawa dan Sumatra, kami memastikan setiap Temulawak dipanen pada saat kematangan ideal, dibersihkan dan disortir dengan teliti, lalu dikemas sesuai standar distribusi internasional. Semua produk kami berasal langsung dari petani lokal binaan, sehingga kualitas, pasokan yang konsisten, serta keberlanjutan selalu terjamin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1400\">Kami siap menyediakan Temulawak premium bersama dengan buah tropis lainnya, sayuran segar, dan rempah-rempah asli Indonesia dalam jumlah besar untuk kebutuhan industri maupun ekspor. Hubungi kami sekarang untuk mendapatkan penawaran terbaik dan jadilah bagian dari jaringan distribusi global kami.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1418\"><strong data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1418\">Spesifikasi:</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1554\">Satuan: Pack<br data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1435\">Kemasan: Standing Pouch<br data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1461\">Tampilan: Kuning-Oranye Cerah<br data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1493\">Kondisi: Tidak Busuk, Tidak Bertunas<br data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1532\">Kulit: Tidak Keriput</p>','<p data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"2158\">From orchard to table &mdash; this is the journey of Temulawak from Indonesia&rsquo;s fertile lands.<br data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1674\">Temulawak, also known as Javanese turmeric, is a traditional Indonesian rhizome with a bright yellow-orange color, strong herbal aroma, and a wide range of health benefits. It is widely used in traditional herbal drinks, wellness beverages, and the cosmetic and pharmaceutical industries due to its high curcuminoid and essential oil content. With its fresh appearance and warm distinctive scent, Indonesian Temulawak is highly sought after in both domestic and international markets.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2518\">As a horticultural supplier from Java and Sumatra, we ensure that every Temulawak rhizome is harvested at the ideal stage of maturity, carefully cleaned and sorted, and packed according to international distribution standards. All our products come directly from trained local farmers, ensuring consistent quality, reliable supply, and sustainable practices.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2785\">We are ready to supply premium Temulawak along with other tropical fruits, fresh vegetables, and authentic Indonesian spices in bulk quantities for industrial and export needs. Contact us today for the best offers and become part of our global distribution network.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2805\"><strong data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2805\">Specification:</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2807\" data-end=\"2941\">Unit: Pack<br data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2820\">Packaging: Standing Pouch<br data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"2848\">Appearance: Bright Yellow-Orange<br data-start=\"2880\" data-end=\"2883\">Condition: Not Rotten, Not Sprouted<br data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2921\">Skin: Not Wrinkled</p>','Temulawak-_Javanese-turmeric_17112025145052.png','Temulawak','Javanese turmeric','Temulawak ','Javanese turmeric','Temulawak kualitas tinggi ','High-quality javanese turmeric','temulawak-','javanese-turmeric','2025-11-17 07:50:53','2025-11-17 07:50:53'),(117,1,'Kencur','Aromatic Ginger','<p data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"597\"><strong>From orchard to table &mdash;</strong> inilah perjalanan Kencur dari tanah subur Indonesia.<br data-start=\"234\" data-end=\"237\">Kencur dikenal sebagai rempah rimpang aromatik dengan ukuran kecil, aroma khas yang hangat dan segar, serta rasa tajam yang banyak digunakan dalam masakan tradisional dan jamu. Dengan daging rimpang berwarna krem dan tekstur yang padat, kencur Indonesia menjadi salah satu bahan herbal penting yang sangat diminati oleh pasar kuliner maupun industri kesehatan.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"964\">Sebagai supplier hortikultura dari Jawa dan Sumatra, kami memastikan setiap Kencur dipanen pada saat kematangan ideal, dibersihkan dengan higienis, disortir secara teliti, dan dikemas sesuai standar distribusi internasional. Semua produk kami berasal langsung dari petani lokal binaan, sehingga kualitas, pasokan yang konsisten, serta keberlanjutan selalu terjamin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1260\">Kami siap menyediakan Kencur premium bersama dengan buah tropis lainnya, sayuran segar, dan rempah-rempah asli Indonesia dalam jumlah besar untuk kebutuhan industri maupun ekspor. Hubungi kami sekarang untuk mendapatkan penawaran terbaik dan jadilah bagian dari jaringan distribusi global kami.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1278\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1278\">Spesifikasi:</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1434\">Satuan: Pack<br data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1295\">Kemasan: Standing Pouch<br data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1321\">Tampilan: Cokelat Muda dengan Daging Rimpang Krem<br data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1373\">Kondisi: Tidak Busuk, Tidak Bertunas<br data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1412\">Kulit: Tidak Keriput</p>','<p data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1925\"><strong>From orchard to table &mdash;</strong> this is the journey of Kencur from Indonesia&rsquo;s fertile lands.<br data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1554\">Kencur, known as aromatic galangal or lesser galangal, is a small rhizome with a warm, refreshing fragrance and a sharp, spicy flavor commonly used in traditional Indonesian dishes and herbal drinks. With its light-brown skin and firm cream-colored flesh, Indonesian Kencur has become an essential herbal ingredient highly demanded in both culinary and health industries.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"2298\">As a horticultural supplier from Java and Sumatra, we ensure that every Kencur rhizome is harvested at the ideal stage of maturity, hygienically cleaned, carefully sorted, and packed according to international distribution standards. All our products come directly from trained local farmers, ensuring consistent quality, stable supply, and sustainable farming practices.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2562\">We are ready to supply premium Kencur along with other tropical fruits, fresh vegetables, and authentic Indonesian spices in bulk quantities for industrial and export needs. Contact us today for the best offers and become part of our global distribution network.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2582\"><strong data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2582\">Specification:</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2739\">Unit: Pack<br data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2597\">Packaging: Standing Pouch<br data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2625\">Appearance: Light Brown Skin with Cream-Colored Flesh<br data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2681\">Condition: Not Rotten, Not Sprouted<br data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2719\">Skin: Not Wrinkled</p>','Kencur_Aromatic-Ginger_17112025150145.png','Kencur','Aromatic Ginger','Kencur','Aromatic Ginger','Kencur kualitas tinggi','High-quality aromatic ginger','kencur','aromatic-ginger','2025-11-17 08:01:46','2025-11-17 08:01:46'),(118,1,' Jahe Merah','Red Ginger','<p data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"638\"><strong>From orchard to table &mdash; </strong>inilah perjalanan Jahe Merah dari tanah subur Indonesia.<br data-start=\"242\" data-end=\"245\">Jahe Merah dikenal dengan aromanya yang kuat, rasa pedas ya