ingga 12 jam</strong>. Indikator kebasahan bawaan akan berubah warna untuk memberi tahu kapan saatnya mengganti popok, sementara lapisan belakang berpori mencegah ruam popok, memastikan kulit lembut bayi Anda tetap sehat dan bebas iritasi.</p>','<p>We Care Diapers are engineered for the modern parent who refuses to compromise on quality. Featuring a&nbsp;<strong>360-degree elastic waistband</strong>&nbsp;for a snug fit and&nbsp;<strong>hypoallergenic cotton-touch layers</strong>, these diapers ensure maximum comfort. The advanced&nbsp;<strong>Magic Gel technology</strong>&nbsp;locks away wetness instantly, providing up to&nbsp;<strong>12 hours of leakage protection</strong>. A built-in wetness indicator changes color to let you know when it\'s time for a change, while breathable back-sheets prevent diaper rash, ensuring your baby\'s delicate skin remains healthy and irritation-free.</p>','We-Care-Diapers_We-Care-Diapers_26112025112728.png','We Care Diapers','We Care Diapers','We Care Diapers','We Care Diapers','We Care Diapers berkualias tinggi.','High Quality We Care Diapers ','we-care-diapers','we-care-diapers','2025-11-26 04:27:28','2025-11-26 04:27:28'),(218,8,'Baby Happy Diapers','Baby Happy Diapers','','','Baby-Happy-Diapers_Baby-Happy-Diapers_26112025130426.png','Baby Happy Diapers','Baby Happy Diapers','Baby Happy Diapers','Baby Happy Diapers','Baby Happy Diapers berkualitas tinggi','High Quality Baby Happy Diapers','baby-happy-diapers','baby-happy-diapers','2025-11-26 06:04:26','2025-11-26 06:04:26'),(219,7,'Wipol Karbol','Wipol Disinfectant','<p><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3,2,0\">Wipol Karbol Wangi Cemara 750 ml adalah cairan disinfektan dan pembersih lantai yang efektif membunuh kuman dan menghilangkan bau tak sedap. Memberikan aroma segar cemara yang tahan lama. <strong>Spesifikasi:</strong> Ukuran: 750 ml. Kemasan: 12 pcs / Dus.</span></p>','<p><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4,2,0\">Wipol Pine Scent Disinfectant 750 ml is a floor cleaner and disinfectant 