1-26 06:17:51'),(221,8,'Nivea Body Lotion','Nivea Body Lotion','<p>Baby Happy Diapers menghadirkan&nbsp;<strong>Air Through Technology</strong>&nbsp;revolusioner, menciptakan kelembutan seperti kapas yang memungkinkan udara bersirkulasi bebas, mengurangi panas, dan mencegah ruam popok. Inti penyerap menggunakan teknologi&nbsp;<strong>Double Pulp Pressure</strong>, yang memadatkan material penyerap agar popok tetap tipis dan ringan tanpa mengurangi kapasitas. Bahkan setelah pipis berkali-kali, popok tetap ramping dan tidak menggumpal berkat struktur polimer berdensitas tinggi. Dilengkapi&nbsp;<strong>Indikator Kebasahan</strong> yang memudar saat waktunya ganti popok.</p>','<p>Baby Happy Diapers feature the revolutionary&nbsp;<strong>Air Through Technology</strong>, creating a cotton-like softness that allows air to circulate freely, reducing heat and preventing diaper rash. The core utilizes&nbsp;<strong>Double Pulp Pressure</strong>&nbsp;technology, which compresses the absorbent material to keep the diaper thin and lightweight without compromising capacity. Even after multiple wettings, the diaper remains slim and does not clump, thanks to the high-density polymer structure. Includes a convenient&nbsp;<strong>Wetness Indicator</strong> that fades when it\'s time to change.</p>','Nivea-Body-Lotion_Nivea-Body-Lotion_26112025132156.png','Nivea Body Lotion','Nivea Body Lotion','Nivea Body Lotion','Nivea Body Lotion','Nivea Body Lotion produk kencantikan berkualitas tinggi','Nivea Body Lotion, a high-quality beauty product','nivea-body-lotion','nivea-body-lotion','2025-11-26 06:21:56','2025-11-26 06:21:56'),(222,8,'Fair dan Lovely FF','Fair and Lovely FF','<p>Tampilkan kecerahan alami kulitmu dengan&nbsp;<strong>Glow &amp; Lovely Advanced Multi Vitamin Facial Foam</strong>. Pembersih wajah yang kaya krim ini menghasilkan busa melimpah yang menembus jauh ke dalam pori-pori untuk mengangkat kotoran, minyak berlebih, dan partikel polusi penyebab kulit kusam. Diperkaya dengan paduan kuat&nbsp;<strong>Vitamin B3, C, dan E</strong>, sabun ini tidak hanya membersihkan tetapi juga menutrisi kulit, membantu menyamarkan noda hitam dan warna kulit tidak merata. Lembut untuk penggunaan sehari-hari, membuat wajah terasa lembap, halus, dan tampak glowing seketika setelah dicuci.</p>','<p>Unveil your skin\'s natural brightness with&nbsp;<strong>Glow &amp; Lovely Advanced Multi Vitamin Facial Foam</strong>. This rich, creamy cleanser creates a luxurious foam that penetrates deep into the pores to lift away impurities, excess oil, and pollution particles that cause dullness. Infused with a potent blend of&nbsp;<strong>Vitamin B3, C, and E</strong>, it not only cleanses but also nourishes the skin, reducing the appearance of dark spots and uneven tone. Gentle enough for daily use, it leaves your face feeling hydrated, soft, and visibly glowing immediately after washing.</p>','Fair-dan-Lovely-FF_Fair-and-Lovely-FF_26112025132822.png','Fair & Lovely FF','Fair & Lovely FF','Fair & Lovely FF','Fair & Lovely FF','Fair & Lovely Advanced Multi Vitamin Facial Foam diformulasikan dengan Tri-Fair Vitamin Complex untuk membersihkan secara mendalam dan mencerahkan wajah seketi','Fair & Lovely Advanced Multi Vitamin Facial Foam is formulated with Tri-Fair Vitamin Complex to deep cleanse and brighten your skin instantly. It removes dirt,','fair-dan-lovely-ff','fair-and-lovely-ff','2025-11-26 06:28:22','2025-11-26 06:28:22'),(223,8,'Ponds Men Facial Foam','Ponds Men Facial Foam','<p>Pond\'s Men menawarkan rangkaian sabun wajah lengkap yang dirancang untuk mengatasi tantangan kulit spesifik yang dihadapi pria. Varian&nbsp;<strong>Energy Charge</strong>&nbsp;memanfaatkan kekuatan&nbsp;<strong>Ekstrak Biji Kopi</strong>&nbsp;untuk mengangkat sel kulit mati dan memberi energi pada kulit kusam, memberikan tampilan cerah dan segar seketika. Bagi mereka yang berjuang melawan jerawat,&nbsp;<strong>Acne Solution</strong>&nbsp;menggunakan teknologi&nbsp;<strong>Thymo-T Essence</strong>&nbsp;yang dipatenkan, yang menargetkan dan memusnahkan bakteri penyebab jerawat jauh di dalam pori-pori hanya dalam 10 detik. Sementara itu,&nbsp;<strong>Lightning Oil Clear</strong>&nbsp;menggunakan&nbsp;<strong>Lumpur Mineral</strong> untuk menyerap minyak berlebih seperti magnet, memastikan wajah bebas kilap seharian.</p>','<p>Pond\'s Men offers a comprehensive range of facial foams designed to tackle the specific skin challenges faced by men. The&nbsp;<strong>Energy Charge</strong>&nbsp;variant harnesses the power of&nbsp;<strong>Coffee Bean Extract</strong>&nbsp;to exfoliate and energize dull skin, giving you a bright, awake look instantly. For those battling breakouts, the&nbsp;<strong>Acne Solution</strong>&nbsp;utilizes the patented&nbsp;<strong>Thymo-T Essence</strong>&nbsp;technology, which targets and destroys acne-causing bacteria deep within the pores in just 10 seconds. Meanwhile, the&nbsp;<strong>Lightning Oil Clear</strong>&nbsp;uses&nbsp;<strong>Mineral Mud</strong> to absorb excess sebum like a magnet, ensuring an oil-free, matte appearance throughout the day.</p>','Ponds-Men-Facial-Foam_Ponds-Men-Facial-Foam_26112025133605.png','Ponds Men Facial Foam','Ponds Men Facial Foam','Ponds Men Facial Foam','Ponds Men Facial Foam','Pond\'s Men Facial Foam diformulasikan khusus untuk melawan masalah kulit pria yang paling tangguh. Mulai dari kekuatan Ekstrak Biji Kopi yang memberi energi hi','Pond\'s Men Facial Foam is specially formulated to combat men\'s toughest skin concerns. From the energizing power of Coffee Bean Extract to the acne-fighting Th','ponds-men-facial-foam','ponds-men-facial-foam','2025-11-26 06:36:05','2025-11-26 06:36:05'),(224,8,'Ponds Bright Facial Wash','Ponds Bright Facial Wash','<p>Ucapkan selamat tinggal pada kulit kusam dengan&nbsp;<strong>Pond\'s Bright Miracle Ultimate Clarity Facial Foam</strong>&nbsp;yang baru. Pembersih canggih ini menghasilkan busa mikro yang kaya dan lembut, mengangkat sel kulit mati dengan lembut sambil menghantarkan dosis kuat&nbsp;<strong>Niasorcinol&trade;</strong> jauh ke dalam kulit. Berbeda dengan pembersih biasa, produk ini tidak hanya membersihkan kotoran; tetapi secara aktif menargetkan akar penyebab kekusaman dan noda hitam. Terbukti secara klinis mengurangi tanda pigmentasi hanya dalam 3 hari, membuat kulit terasa lembap, halus, dan memancarkan kilau jernih sebening kristal.</p>','<p>Say goodbye to dull skin with the new&nbsp;<strong>Pond\'s Bright Miracle Ultimate Clarity Facial Foam</strong>. This advanced cleanser produces a rich, creamy micro-foam that gently exfoliates dead skin cells while delivering a powerful dose of&nbsp;<strong>Niasorcinol&trade;</strong> deep into the skin. Unlike standard cleansers, it doesn\'t just wash away dirt; it actively targets the root cause of dullness and dark spots. Clinically proven to reduce pigmentation marks in just 3 days, it leaves your skin feeling hydrated, soft, and radiating a crystal-clear glow.</p>','Ponds-Bright-Facial-Wash_Ponds-Bright-Facial-Wash_26112025134042.png','Ponds Bright Facial Wash','Ponds Bright Facial Wash','Ponds Bright Facial Wash','Ponds Bright Facial Wash','Rasakan Pond\'s Bright Miracle Ultimate Clarity Facial Foam baru, kini ditenagai oleh Niasorcinol™. Formula terobosan ini menggabungkan Niacinamide dan E-Resorc','Experience the new Pond\'s Bright Miracle Ultimate Clarity Facial Foam, now powered by Niasorcinol™. This breakthrough formula combines Niacinamide and E-Resorc','ponds-bright-facial-wash','ponds-bright-facial-wash','2025-11-26 06:40:43','2025-11-26 06:40:43'),(225,7,'WPC Porselen','WPC Porselen Cleaner','<p><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3,2,0\">WPC Porselen Cleaner hadir dalam dua ukuran untuk membersihkan noda pada porselen dan keramik dengan formula kental yang efektif. <strong>Spesifikasi:</strong> <strong>Ukuran 400 ml:</strong> Kemasan 12 pcs / Box (atau per karton). <strong>Ukuran 780 ml:</strong> Kemasan 6 pcs / Box (atau per karton).</span></p>','<p><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4,2,0\">WPC Porcelain Cleaner is available in two sizes with a thick formula effective for cleaning stains on porcelain and ceramic surfaces. <strong>Specifications:</strong> <strong>400 ml Size:</strong> Packing 12 pcs / Box (or per carton). <strong>780 ml Size:</strong> Packing 6 pcs / Box (or per carton).</span></p>','WPC-Porselen_WPC-Porselen-Cleaner_26112025134154.jpg','WPCPembersihPorselen400dan780ml','WPCPorcelainCleaner400and780ml','Jual WPC Porselen Cleaner 400ml dan 780ml Pembersih Keramik','Export WPC Porcelain Ceramic Cleaner 400ml & 780ml','WPC Porselen Cleaner tersedia ukuran 400 ml (12 pcs/box) dan 780 ml (6 pcs/box) untuk noda membandel. Hubungi Indonesian Exporter.','WPC Porcelain Cleaner available in 400ml (12 pcs/box) and 780ml (6 pcs/box) for tough stains. Contact Indonesian Exporter for export.','wpc-porselen','wpc-porselen-cleaner','2025-11-26 06:41:54','2025-11-26 06:41:54'),(226,8,'Nivea Sparkling White Facial Foam','Nivea Sparkling White Facial Foam','<p>Nivea Sparkling White (Extra Bright) Facial Foam dirancang untuk wanita yang ingin mengembalikan kilau alami kulit mereka. Formulanya meresap jauh ke dalam pori-pori untuk mengangkat kotoran, minyak, dan sisa make-up penyebab kulit kusam. Keunggulannya terletak pada&nbsp;<strong>Pearl Whitening Complex</strong> yang dikombinasikan dengan Ekstrak Licorice, yang bekerja menyamarkan noda hitam dan bekas jerawat. Pentingnya lagi, produk ini mengandung agen pembersih lembut dan Gliserin, memastikan bahwa meskipun kulit Anda menjadi bersih berkilau, kulit tidak pernah terasa kaku atau kehilangan kelembapan alaminya.</p>','<p>Nivea Sparkling White (Extra Bright) Facial Foam is designed for women who want to restore their skin\'s natural radiance. The formula penetrates deep into the pores to remove dirt, oil, and makeup residue that causes dullness. What sets it apart is the&nbsp;<strong>Pearl Whitening Complex</strong> combined with Licorice Extract, which works to fade dark spots and acne marks. Crucially, it contains gentle cleansing agents and Glycerin, ensuring that while your skin becomes sparkling clean, it never feels tight or stripped of its natural oils.</p>','Nivea-Sparkling-White-Facial-Foam_Nivea-Sparkling-White-Facial-Foam_26112025134815.png','Nivea Sparkling White Facial Foam','Nivea Sparkling White Facial Foam','Nivea Sparkling White Facial Foam','Nivea Sparkling White Facial Foam','Nivea Sparkling White Facial Foam membersihkan dengan lembut dan mencerahkan kulit kusam. Diperkaya dengan Pearl Whitening Complex, efektif mengangkat kotoran ','Nivea Sparkling White Facial Foam gently cleanses and brightens dull skin. Enriched with Pearl Whitening Complex, it effectively removes impurities and minimiz','nivea-sparkling-white-facial-foam','nivea-sparkling-white-facial-foam','2025-11-26 06:48:15','2025-11-26 06:48:15'),(227,8,'Dove Deo','Dove Deo','<section class=\"border-t border-gray-100 pt-12\">\r\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-7 text-justify\">Kita sering melupakan kulit ketiak kita, hanya merawatnya dengan bahan kimia keras atau pisau cukur.&nbsp;<strong>Dove Deodorant Original</strong>&nbsp;mengubah narasi tersebut. Diperkaya dengan&nbsp;<strong>&frac14; moisturizing cream</strong>&nbsp;khasnya serta Vitamin E dan F (dari minyak biji bunga matahari), Dove menutrisi kulit untuk membantunya pulih dari iritasi akibat bercukur. Formulanya mengandung&nbsp;<strong>0% alkohol</strong>, sehingga cocok bahkan untuk kulit sensitif, namun tetap cukup kuat untuk memberikan perlindungan 48 jam terhadap keringat dan bau badan. Wangi bedak yang bersih dan khas membuat Anda merasa segar dan percaya diri sepanjang hari.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>','<p>We often forget about our underarm skin, treating it only with harsh chemicals or razor blades.&nbsp;<strong>Dove Original Deodorant</strong>&nbsp;changes that narrative. Infused with its signature&nbsp;<strong>&frac14; moisturizing cream</strong>&nbsp;and Vitamins E and F (from sunflower seed oil), it nourishes the skin to help it recover from the irritation caused by shaving. The formula contains&nbsp;<strong>0% alcohol</strong>, making it suitable even for sensitive skin, yet it remains powerful enough to provide 48-hour protection against sweat and odor. The signature clean, powdery scent leaves you feeling fresh and confident all day.</p>','Dove-Deo_Dove-Deo_26112025135456.png','Dove Deo','Dove Deo','Dove Deo','Dove Deo','Dove Deodorant Original adalah satu-satunya yang diperkaya dengan ¼ moisturizing cream unik kami. Lebih dari sekadar perlindungan 48 jam, Dove merawat kulit ke','Dove Original Deodorant is the only one enriched with our unique ¼ moisturizing cream. It goes beyond 48-hour protection to actively care for your delicate und','dove-deo','dove-deo','2025-11-26 06:54:56','2025-11-26 06:54:56'),(228,8,'Rexona Women Deo Roll On','Rexona Women Deo Roll On','<p>Rexona Women Deodorant Roll On dirancang untuk wanita yang tak pernah berhenti bergerak. Intinya adalah teknologi terobosan&nbsp;<strong>MotionSense&trade;</strong>, yang mengandung mikrokapsul pintar yang merespons langsung gerakan tubuh Anda. Tidak seperti deodoran biasa yang memudar sepanjang hari, Rexona bekerja lebih keras saat Anda aktif. Baik Anda memilih&nbsp;<strong>Advanced Whitening</strong>&nbsp;dengan Vitamin C &amp; E untuk ketiak lebih cerah, atau&nbsp;<strong>Shower Clean</strong> untuk wangi segar seharian, Anda mendapatkan perlindungan 48 jam dari keringat dan bau badan. Bebas alkohol dan telah diuji secara dermatologis.</p>','<p>Rexona Women Deodorant Roll On is engineered for women who never stop moving. At its heart is the breakthrough&nbsp;<strong>MotionSense&trade;</strong>&nbsp;technology, which contains smart microcapsules that respond directly to your body\'s movement. Unlike standard deodorants that fade during the day, Rexona works harder when you do. Whether you choose&nbsp;<strong>Advanced Whitening</strong>&nbsp;with Vitamin C &amp; E for brighter underarms, or&nbsp;<strong>Shower Clean</strong> for an all-day fresh scent, you get 48-hour protection against sweat and body odor. Alcohol-free and dermatologist tested.</p>','Rexona-Women-Deo-Roll-On_Rexona-Women-Deo-Roll-On_26112025140104.png','Rexona Women Deo Roll On','Rexona Women Deo Roll On','Rexona Women Deo Roll On','Rexona Women Deo Roll On','Rexona Women Roll On dilengkapi teknologi eksklusif MotionSense™. Mikrokapsul menempel di kulit dan pecah karena gesekan untuk melepaskan keharuman segar tepat','Rexona Women Roll On features exclusive MotionSense™ technology. Microcapsules sit on your skin and burst with friction to release fresh fragrance precisely wh','rexona-women-deo-roll-on','rexona-women-deo-roll-on','2025-11-26 07:01:04','2025-11-26 07:01:04'),(229,7,'Harpic Disinfektan','Harpic Disinfectant','<p><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3,2,0\">Harpic Disinfektan Kamar Mandi Serbaguna 450 ml. Cairan ini diformulasikan untuk membersihkan dan mendisinfeksi permukaan kamar mandi, membunuh kuman, dan memberikan kesegaran yang higienis. <strong>Spesifikasi:</strong> Ukuran: 450 ml per botol. Kemasan: 12 pcs / karton.</span></p>','<p><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4,2,0\">Harpic Multipurpose Bathroom Disinfectant 450 ml. This liquid is formulated to clean and disinfect bathroom surfaces, killing germs and providing hygienic freshness. <strong>Specifications:</strong> Size: 450 ml per bottle. Packing: 12 pcs / carton.</span></p>','Harpic-Disinfektan_Harpic-Disinfectant_26112025140340.jpg','HarpicDisinfektanKamarMandi450ml','HarpicBathroomDisinfectant450ml','Jual Harpic Disinfektan Kamar Mandi Serbaguna 450ml','Export Harpic Multipurpose Bathroom Disinfectant 450ml','Harpic Disinfektan 450 ml efektif membunuh kuman dan membersihkan kamar mandi. Packing 12 pcs/karton. Hubungi Indonesian Exporter untuk ekspor.','Harpic Disinfektan 450 ml efektif membunuh kuman dan membersihkan kamar mandi. Packing 12 pcs/karton. Hubungi Indonesian Exporter untuk ekspor.','harpic-disinfektan','harpic-disinfectant','2025-11-26 07:03:40','2025-11-26 07:03:40'),(230,7,'Harpic Power Plus','Harpic Power Plus','<p><span data-path-to-node=\"3,3,2,0\">Harpic Power Plus 750 ml adalah pembersih toilet/kloset dengan formula 5x lebih kuat untuk membersihkan noda membandel, kerak, dan kuman. Dirancang khusus untuk kloset. <strong>Spesifikasi:</strong> Ukuran: 750 ml per botol. Kemasan: 12 pcs / karton.</span></p>','<p><span data-path-to-node=\"3,4,2,0\">Harpic Power Plus 750 ml is a toilet cleaner with a 5x stronger formula to remove tough stains, grime, and germs. Specifically designed for toilets. <strong>Specifications:</strong> Size: 750 ml per bottle. Packing: 12 pcs / carton.</span></p>','Harpic-Power-Plus_Harpic-Power-Plus_26112025140552.jpg','HarpicPowerPlusPembersihKloset750ml','HarpicPowerPlusToiletCleaner750ml','Jual Harpic Power Plus 750ml Pembersih Kloset Extra Kuat','Export Harpic Power Plus Toilet Cleaner 750ml Extra Strong','Harpic Power Plus 750 ml dengan formula 5x lebih kuat untuk noda kloset membandel. Packing 12 pcs/karton. Hubungi Indonesian Exporter.','Harpic Power Plus 750ml with 5x stronger formula for tough toilet stains. Packing 12 pcs/carton. Contact Indonesian Exporter for export.','harpic-power-plus','harpic-power-plus','2025-11-26 07:05:52','2025-11-26 07:05:52'),(231,8,'Rexona Men Deo Roll On','Rexona Men Deo Roll On','<p>Jangan biarkan keringat mengganggu fokus Anda. Rexona Men Deodorant Roll On diformulasikan dengan&nbsp;<strong>bahan aktif antiperspiran</strong>&nbsp;yang secara fisik menghalangi kelenjar keringat agar Anda tetap kering. Pembeda utamanya adalah&nbsp;<strong>teknologi MotionSense&trade;</strong>: mikrokapsul menempel di kulit dan pecah akibat gesekan gerakan, melepaskan wangi segar tepat saat Anda paling membutuhkannya. Efektif melawan bakteri yang hidup pada keringat, mencegah bau badan langsung dari sumbernya.</p>','<p>Don\'t let sweat interrupt your focus. Rexona Men Deodorant Roll On is formulated with&nbsp;<strong>anti-perspirant actives</strong>&nbsp;that physically block sweat ducts to keep you dry. The key differentiator is the&nbsp;<strong>MotionSense&trade; technology</strong>: microcapsules sit on your skin and burst with friction from movement, releasing a fresh scent just when you need it most. It effectively fights the bacteria that live on sweat, preventing body odor at the source.</p>','Rexona-Men-Deo-Roll-On_Rexona-Men-Deo-Roll-On_26112025140839.png','Rexona Men Deo Roll On','Rexona Men Deo Roll On','Rexona Men Deo Roll On','Rexona Men Deo Roll On','Rexona Men Roll On dibuat untuk gaya hidup intensitas tinggi. Ditenagai oleh teknologi MotionSense™, melepaskan ledakan kesegaran di setiap gerakan Anda. Baik ','Rexona Men Roll On is built for high-intensity lifestyles. Powered by MotionSense™ technology, it releases bursts of freshness with every move you make. Whethe','rexona-men-deo-roll-on','rexona-men-deo-roll-on','2025-11-26 07:08:39','2025-11-26 07:08:39'),(232,7,'Sunlight Cair Pencuci Piring','Sunlight Dishwash Liquid','<p><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3,2,0\">Sunlight Cairan Pencuci Piring Extra Higienis 650 ml kemasan <em>refill</em> dengan kekuatan 100% Sari Lemon. Efektif menghilangkan lemak dan bau tak sedap, serta memberikan perlindungan higienis. <strong>Spesifikasi:</strong> Ukuran: 650 ml per <em>pouch</em>/<em>botol</em>. Kemasan: 12 pcs / karton.</span></p>','<p><span data-path-to-node=\"4,4,2,0\">Sunlight Dishwash Liquid Extra Hygienic 650 ml <em>refill</em> pack with the power of 100% Lemon extract. Effectively removes grease and unpleasant odors, and provides hygienic protection. <strong>Specifications:</strong> Size: 650 ml per <em>pouch</em>/<em>bottle</em>. Packing: 12 pcs / carton.</span></p>','Sunlight-Cair-Pencuci-Piring_Sunlight-Dishwash-Liquid_26112025140914.webp','SunlightPencuciPiringRefill650ml','SunlightDishwashRefill650ml','Jual Sunlig