busta greenbean = USD 3.9/kg','0.01','Sudah, Melalui Pihak Ketiga',0,'2026-10-23 02:43:47','2026-10-23 02:43:47'),(5,63,'Snack & Instan Food','5000 pcs per hari','5000 pcs per hari','PT','HALAL HAKI PIRT HACCP','Bandung','https://drive.google.com/open?id=1HK3YecDTc-Q8yM9mBPujOXq0vF0UCxB4',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pricelist akan kami lampirkan','Pricelist akan kami lampirkan','Up to 25%','Sudah, Melalui Pihak Ketiga',0,'2026-10-23 02:43:47','2026-10-23 02:43:47'),(6,56,'Kulit ikan kering & fish skin snack','Kulit ikan kering : ikan patin, pure , drysun kelembapan 10-15% kapasitas 2 ton/bulan\n\nFish skin snack : snack kulit ikan varian rasa nusantara ( original, soto, rendang, sambal matah) , halal dan BPOM berat 60 gr','Kulit ikan kering : ikan patin, pure , drysun kelembapan 10-15% kapasitas 2 ton/bulan\n\nFish skin snack : snack kulit ikan varian rasa nusantara ( original, soto, rendang, sambal matah) , halal dan BPOM berat 60 gr','NiB','Halal, BPOM','Kab. Banyuwangi','https://drive.google.com/open?id=1WlUYuCldKfPj4sEFVli_b6QMZZr7UJw1','https://drive.google.com/open?id=1QSk9xmg1rJI_ToRSdnxY3sx-YQuiDPX3','https://drive.google.com/open?id=16_ZOBtBu8BLmJbjrpSTD4xsBbwf3Qh9T',NULL,NULL,'Fish skin snack exwork : USD 1$ /PCS (MoQ : 5.000 pcs )\nKulit ikan kering exwork : USD 8$/kg (MOQ : 1 ton)','Fish skin snack exwork : USD 1$ /PCS (MoQ : 5.000 pcs )\nKulit ikan kering exwork : USD 8$/kg (MOQ : 1 ton)','Komisi 10%','Sudah, Melalui Pihak Ketiga',0,'2026-10-23 02:43:47','2026-10-23 02:43:47'),(7,83,'Furniture','500 pcs tiap produk','500 pcs tiap produk','NIB','SVLK','Jepara','https://drive.google.com/open?id=18FrbXS4_ZbKrqj4EEoAXzxNPPfqL5d2B','https://drive.google.com/open?id=1s4mJJ977WMQqkQg269p3K4zHxDOPo3fQ','https://drive.google.com/open?id=1gJCSO4oAX6-oGSYkc_DosTl8xkvZmd7X',NULL,NULL,'Tidak Ada MOQ','Tidak Ada MOQ','Komisi belum dihitung','Sudah, Ekspor Mandiri',0,'2026-10-23 02:43:47','2026-10-23 02:43:47'),(8,84,'Madu murni akasia','Murni Asli 1000 kg/minggu','Murni Asli 1000 kg/minggu','NIB, NKV, Halal','Merek, NKV, Halal','Pekanbaru','https://drive.google.com/open?id=1vnAxcWdARdJ2SoA3eP9gW0CmYXCNS4sr',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Madu Murni = USD 8 /kg (MOQ 300 kg)','Madu Murni = USD 8 /kg (MOQ 300 kg)','0.1','Belum Pernah',0,'2026-10-23 02:43:47','2026-10-23 02:43:47'),(9,85,'Wallpanel dari recycled Teak/ hardwood, Wallpanel dari batok kelapa, coconut furniture, bamboo furniture, bamboo products, teak bathroom furniture, teak garden furniture, sauna','all product : 3x40 ft / month','all product : 3x40 ft / month','NIB, NPWP','SVLK, FSC, BSCI','Jepara','https://drive.google.com/open?id=1vd7_DXpJgHUy7zOkrOcNcW8y_tcnbYnM',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'sales komisi sekitar 2,5 - 3% dari Invoice','sales komisi sekitar 2,5 - 3% dari Invoice','sales komisi sekitar 2,5 - 3% dari Invoice','Sudah, Ekspor Mandiri',0,'2026-10-23 02:43:47','2026-10-23 02:43:47'),(10,72,'Pakaian Kerja , Wearpack Kerja, Personal Protective equipment, Pakaian Safety, Jaket Tambang, Hivis Jacket','2000 pcs /item/month','2000 pcs /item/month','NIB , CV','HKI Merk, SNI, Halal','Kota Malang','https://drive.google.com/open?id=1ecyAj4NtRkUKltOQ8XIKtJ5p8nNwLVGM','https://drive.google.com/open?id=1UcZT1le1fDjVhwlQLF559NVUnD9fe3sm','https://drive.google.com/open?id=1s4JWZlTvdNVMyf51JqoQVVjFUbpUlRnw',NULL,NULL,'300.000 - 700.000 per pcs . MOQ 100 pcs','300.000 - 700.000 per pcs . MOQ 100 pcs','Komisi 10% ( 30.000-70.000 ) / pcs','Belum',0,'2026-10-23 02:43:47','2026-10-23 04:14:54');
